  "answer": "2x sin(x) + x^2 cos(x)",
  "mistakes": [],
  "hints": [
    "f is a product u·v with u = x² and v = sin x.",
    "(uv)′ = u′v + uv′."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Let $u = x^2$, $v = \\sin x$, so $u' = 2x$ and $v' = \\cos x$.",
    "$f'(x) = u'v + uv' = 2x\\sin x + x^2 \\cos x$."
  ],
